// mb_str_pad (>=8.3) and mb_ucfirst / mb_lcfirst / mb_ltrim / mb_rtrim /
// mb_trim (>=8.4) are gated in Layer 1 Ext.Mbstring.tyhpdef inside
// declare(php=…) blocks. Overlaying the same gated names here would be a
// second gated copy of the same symbol, which is TYHP4303 (duplicate
// declaration with overlapping PHP version constraints) rather than a
// replace, so do not overlay those names here.
